OL,3,GNEWSABusiness denied flood insurance
OL,4,Aworried for future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business next to a village brook says
OL,7,Fit can no longer get insurance cover
OL,8,Fagainst flood damage after making a
OL,9,Fclaim following flooding last year.
OL,11,FSarah Ward, owner of The BREWery in
OL,12,FHigh Street, Sileby, made a claim after
OL,13,Fthe shop was forced to close for eight
OL,14,Fdays when the brook flooded in January
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FWard said that when the policy came up
OL,18,Ffor renewal, her premium quadrupled to
OL,19,F#1,600 and flood cover was removed.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
