OL,3,GNEWSABusiness denied flood insurance
OL,4,Aworried for future
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm covered for theft, fire,
OL,7,Fliabilities with public and that kind
OL,8,Fof thing, but not for flooding," Ward
OL,9,Fsaid.
